# Parameters for script/Deploy.s.sol. Copy to .env in this directory (gitignored):
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Forge reads .env from the directory it runs in. A variable already set in your shell
# wins over the one here. Upgrade.s.sol and SetSubscriptionFee.s.sol read nothing from
# the environment: what they act on is in script/Deployments.sol.
#
# No private key belongs in this file. Sign with a Foundry keystore instead:
#
#   cast wallet import <name> --interactive
#   forge script … --account <name> --sender <its address>

# Required. The admin every new contract is created with: fees, takedowns and
# upgrades. There is no default. For all(), appRegistry() and dataRegistry() it must be
# the address that signs, because the wiring calls are admin-only.
ADMIN_ADDR=

# Everything below is optional and shows its default.

# AppRegistry: what claiming or renewing an app costs, in USDC base units (6 decimals:
# 5000000 is 5 USDC).
# SUBSCRIPTION_FEE=0

# AppRegistry: how long one subscription payment lasts, in seconds (2592000 is 30 days).
# The admin can change it later; a change applies from each app's next payment.
# SUBSCRIPTION_PERIOD=2592000

# Contracts the registries call. They default to the deployments on Base Sepolia; on any
# other chain both are required.
# USDC_ADDR=0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e
# SEMAPHORE_ADDR=0x8A1fd199516489B0Fb7153EB5f075cDAC83c693D
